00:29:05.944 --> 00:29:08.279
but the devil is in
the details, man.

00:29:08.279 --> 00:29:10.115 align:start size:81% position:19%
You got to do a
detailed analysis.

00:29:10.115 --> 00:29:11.716
It's like, the leftists say,

00:29:11.716 --> 00:29:13.685 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Well, the whole judicial
system is corrupt."

00:29:13.685 --> 00:29:15.120
