00:33:56.234 --> 00:33:59.504
But the thing about those
people is, they're busy.

00:34:00.671 --> 00:34:02.106
Their days are scheduled.

00:34:02.106 --> 00:34:03.574 align:start size:94% position:6%
It doesn't matter if
they're former presidents

00:34:03.574 --> 00:34:05.443 align:start size:88% position:13%
or prime ministers,
their days are scheduled

00:34:05.443 --> 00:34:07.678
to the minute for like 16 hours.

00:34:07.678 --> 00:34:09.580 align:start size:84% position:16%
Well, they don't
have time to sit and

00:34:09.580 --> 00:34:10.381
analyze

00:34:12.550 --> 00:34:14.752 align:start size:81% position:19%
the sustainable
development goals.

00:34:14.752 --> 00:34:17.955
So then it falls down the
hierarchy of bureaucracy

00:34:17.955 --> 00:34:20.758 align:start size:94% position:6%
until it lands on the desk
of someone who actually

00:34:20.758 --> 00:34:23.561
either wants to, or
has time to do it.

00:34:23.561 --> 00:34:25.096
And God only knows
how many tiers down

00:34:25.096 --> 00:34:27.999 align:start size:88% position:13%
it has to fall before
that person takes it on.

00:34:27.999 --> 00:34:30.435
And then are they
trained to do this?

00:34:30.435 --> 00:34:31.669
Well, no.

00:34:31.669 --> 00:34:34.105
The only person I know
that's trained to do it

00:34:34.105 --> 00:34:35.273
would be Lomborg.

00:34:37.208 --> 00:34:40.311 align:start size:88% position:13%
And he doesn't have
the expertise necessary
to really do it,

00:34:40.311 --> 00:34:42.246 align:start size:81% position:19%
but he's still the
one I would say

00:34:42.246 --> 00:34:44.916 align:start size:88% position:13%
knows better than
anyone broadly speaking,

00:34:44.916 --> 00:34:45.850
that I've met.

00:34:46.984 --> 00:34:49.921 align:start size:88% position:13%
And it's not like we
have training schools to

00:34:49.921 --> 00:34:52.223
prepare people, to
prepare documents

00:34:52.223 --> 00:34:53.925 align:start size:94% position:6%
on sustainable
development over the next

00:34:53.925 --> 00:34:55.526
100 years for the planet,

00:34:55.526 --> 00:34:57.628
it requires so much expertise.

00:34:59.230 --> 00:35:01.632
And so these things
are cobbled together,

00:35:02.800 --> 00:35:04.669
and it's not even
that conspiracy,

00:35:04.669 --> 00:35:07.004 align:start size:84% position:16%
you don't have to
pause the conspiracy.

00:35:07.972 --> 00:35:09.140
Now ideas can take on a

00:35:09.140 --> 00:35:12.477 align:start size:84% position:16%
conspiratorial
formal by themselves,

00:35:12.477 --> 00:35:14.846
this is no conspiracy.

00:35:14.846 --> 00:35:17.415
It's so badly done that
it's quite frightening.

00:35:17.415 --> 00:35:19.851
- So then where would you piece

00:35:19.851 --> 00:35:21.719
the algorithmic part of this,

00:35:21.719 --> 00:35:24.422 align:start size:94% position:6%
the tech part that then
