00:35:35.266 --> 00:35:37.502 align:start size:88% position:13%
and then keeping a whole
bunch of other people

00:35:37.502 --> 00:35:40.371
in a perpetual state
of confusion or fear.

00:35:40.371 --> 00:35:42.707 align:start size:88% position:13%
I mean, that's the piece
of this that emerged

00:35:42.707 --> 00:35:45.209
just in the last 20
years, that seems to

00:35:45.209 --> 00:35:46.611
hide the rest of it,

00:35:46.611 --> 00:35:48.446 align:start size:97% position:3%
it sits higher in that
hierarchy than the rest of it.

00:35:48.446 --> 00:35:50.848
- Okay, I need more specificity.

