00:36:01.058 --> 00:36:03.294
that keeps us all
watching things,

00:36:03.294 --> 00:36:04.996 align:start size:84% position:16%
that keeps us all
looking at our phones.

00:36:04.996 --> 00:36:06.264
- Well, oh, I see what you mean.

00:36:06.264 --> 00:36:07.765
- Often is done by
a class of people,

00:36:07.765 --> 00:36:10.535 align:start size:94% position:6%
that are not the ones that
