Well, let's play angels
advocate for a minute.

00:36:21.179 --> 00:36:23.080
Okay, they are really
trying to deliver you

00:36:23.080 --> 00:36:24.549
something you will attend to,

00:36:25.716 --> 00:36:27.351 align:start size:81% position:19%
