00:57:30.079 --> 00:57:31.681
that you don't even recognize

00:57:31.681 --> 00:57:33.583 align:start size:84% position:16%
that you're peppering
the question with

00:57:33.583 --> 00:57:36.386
to force me into
a box to deliver

00:57:36.386 --> 00:57:38.655
the kind, answer that
your question demands

00:57:38.655 --> 00:57:40.690
given the way you phrased it."

00:57:40.690 --> 00:57:42.592
It's like, "No,

00:57:44.060 --> 00:57:47.564
you say you don't believe in
God, well God is ineffable."

00:57:47.564 --> 00:57:49.032
What do you mean you
don't believe in God?

00:57:49.032 --> 00:57:51.167 align:start size:88% position:13%
Well what do you believe
in then, nothing?

00:57:51.167 --> 00:57:52.035
Well, no.

00:57:52.035 --> 00:57:53.536
Everything?

00:57:53.536 --> 00:57:55.205
Well, no that doesn't work
'cause then you're chaotic.

00:57:55.205 --> 00:57:56.906
Well what's your highest value,

00:57:56.906 --> 00:58:00.743
diversity, equity, inclusivity?

00:58:00.743 --> 00:58:02.145
Well, I don't need
a highest value.

00:58:02.145 --> 00:58:04.581 align:start size:97% position:3%
Well yes you do 'cause
otherwise nothing orients you

00:58:04.581 --> 00:58:06.683 align:start size:84% position:16%
