landscape of choices.

00:58:07.550 --> 00:58:09.052
This isn't optional.

00:58:09.052 --> 00:58:11.020 align:start size:84% position:16%
- So to give the
devil his due, then,

00:58:11.020 --> 00:58:12.288
- Yeah.

00:58:12.288 --> 00:58:13.323
- when you've had
the conversations

00:58:13.323 --> 00:58:14.858
