again also, all of these guys.

00:58:16.659 --> 00:58:17.861
- Yeah, that went
great by the way.

00:58:17.861 --> 00:58:18.895
- At the end

00:58:20.196 --> 00:58:22.365 align:start size:84% position:16%
people that are not
