00:59:30.333 --> 00:59:33.870
But the thing is, is that Sam
certainly believes in evil.

00:59:35.038 --> 00:59:36.873
Okay, well, if you
believe in evil,

00:59:36.873 --> 00:59:38.775
you also believe in good,

00:59:38.775 --> 00:59:41.578
because good is the opposite
of evil, whatever that is.

00:59:42.512 --> 00:59:43.980
And well what's God?

00:59:45.248 --> 00:59:46.716
Well, God is what's good.

00:59:47.617 --> 00:59:48.651
Well, okay, what does that mean?

00:59:48.651 --> 00:59:50.019
Is he a spirit?

00:59:50.019 --> 00:59:51.354
