00:59:51.354 --> 00:59:53.489
What do you mean by spirit?

00:59:53.489 --> 00:59:54.991 align:start size:84% position:16%
So here's something
to think about,

00:59:54.991 --> 00:59:57.093
this is what I think.

00:59:57.093 --> 00:59:59.462
When I look back at the good men

00:59:59.462 --> 01:00:02.699
