that each of them is good.

01:00:10.006 --> 01:00:11.808
Well, the essence of that good,

01:00:11.808 --> 01:00:14.177
that's no different than God,

01:00:14.177 --> 01:00:15.612
it might even be God.

01:00:16.980 --> 01:00:18.948 align:start size:97% position:3%
Now you say, "Well, what
does that mean, that spirit."

01:00:18.948 --> 01:00:22.085
Well it's whatever is common
among good men, let's say,

01:00:22.085 --> 01:00:23.286
