01:00:38.501 --> 01:00:41.671
it's so disembodied, it has
no connection to the world.

01:00:41.671 --> 01:00:45.174
And that causes the death
of God, that abstraction.

01:00:45.174 --> 01:00:48.544 align:start size:88% position:13%
Mircea Eliade
documented deaths of God

01:00:48.544 --> 01:00:50.480
in many cultures across history.

01:00:50.480 --> 01:00:51.814 align:start size:88% position:13%
It's not only
something that happened

01:00:51.814 --> 01:00:53.650
in the West that NCHE announced.

01:00:53.650 --> 01:00:55.251 align:start size:84% position:16%
And it happens when
the idea of God

01:00:55.251 --> 01:00:56.819
gets so abstracted

01:00:56.819 --> 01:00:59.355
that it no longer has any
connection with the world.

01:01:00.757 --> 01:01:02.492 align:start size:97% position:3% line:0%
